{{ill|Sakata Shinmei Shrine|ja|坂田神明宮|qq=draft|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sakata Shinmei Shrine|qq=}}  is a regional [[Sōja shrine|Sōja shrine]]. It enshrines many kami of the local region.

It contrasts with provincial Soja shrines which enshrine all the kami of a province<ref>https://archive.ph/wip/XtZfZ</ref>

It is also a {{ill|Moto-Ise Shrines|ja|元伊勢|1=Moto-Ise Shrines|lt=Motoise shrine|qq=draft|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Moto-Ise Shrines|13=User:Immanuelle/Moto-Ise Shrines|qq=}}

==Overview==

